[{"sha":"fcdf1092870772ae4411cf52444b8d970d0269a8","node_id":"C_kwDOS7HTFdoAKGZjZGYxMDkyODcwNzcyYWU0NDExY2Y1MjQ0NGI4ZDk3MGQwMjY5YTg","commit":{"author":{"name":"Konstantin Kirchheim","email":"konstantin.kirchheim@ovgu.de","date":"2026-07-22T08:19:11Z"},"committer":{"name":"Konstantin Kirchheim","email":"konstantin.kirchheim@ovgu.de","date":"2026-07-22T08:19:11Z"},"message":"Migrate baselines to the new carlanomaly devkit API\n\nThe devkit (github.com/carlanomaly/devkit) renamed its \"frame\" terminology\nto \"timestep\" throughout: ScenarioIndex.frames_for -> timesteps_for,\nObservationEvaluator -> TimestepEvaluator, ScenarioRecord.n_frames ->\nn_timesteps. No metric semantics changed, only names.\n\nAlso adopt the new WithIdentifiers dataset wrapper, replacing the\nhand-rolled scenario_id/frame_id plumbing in each baseline's EvalDataset\nwith the wrapper's {\"data\", \"scenario_id\", \"timesteps\"} envelope, and\ncarlanomaly_collate_fn where the per-item shape is uniform.\n\nVerified by re-running all four baselines end-to-end: every metric\n(miou, oa, sensor/pixel/point AUROC, reconstruction MSE/PSNR, multimodal\nfusion AUROC) matches the pre-migration results exactly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016BA7D9oQunvJuQtAHaVZFR","tree":{"sha":"64e9f7df2917cdbdde87f32191f782dd032c1fc2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carlanomaly/baselines/git/trees/64e9f7df2917cdbdde87f32191f782dd032c1fc2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carlanomaly/baselines/git/commits/fcdf1092870772ae4411cf52444b8d970d0269a8","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carlanomaly/baselines/commits/fcdf1092870772ae4411cf52444b8d970d0269a8","html_url":"https://github.com/carlanomaly/baselines/commit/fcdf1092870772ae4411cf52444b8d970d0269a8","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carlanomaly/baseli